---
// Sección de video demostrativo del prototipo en funcionamiento
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-24 md:py-32 bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-bg relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-200" id="demo">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-16 reveal-init">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4 sm:mb-5">
        El hardware en acción
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted font-medium">
        ESP32 + PZEM-004T + Relay montados en carcasa para instalación doméstica. Aquí puedes ver el prototipo v1.0 de Slimergy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Imagen del prototipo físico -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal-init">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] overflow-hidden border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none group">
          <img 
            src="/assets/img/prototype.webp" 
            alt="Prototipo Slimergy — ESP32 + PZEM-004T + Relay 5V" 
            width="600"
            height="420"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-[220px] sm:h-[420px] object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md text-white font-mono text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">
              ESP32 · PZEM-004T · Relay 5V
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 text-white">
            <span class="bg-slimergy-green/90 text-slimergy-green-dark text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full inline-block mb-1.5">
              Prototipo v1.0 · Innovatec 2026
            </span>
            <h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black leading-snug">Gabinete de montaje para instalación doméstica</h4>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Video demostrativo y puntos clave -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal-init reveal-d1">
        <div class="bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] p-5 sm:p-8 border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none transition-colors duration-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white mb-2 sm:mb-3">Demo del sistema funcionando</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Mira el prototipo Slimergy en tiempo real: el sensor PZEM-004T midiendo la corriente AC, los datos fluyendo por WiFi al broker MQTT HiveMQ y la app React Native actualizándose automáticamente cada 2 segundos.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-center">
            
            <div class="sm:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
              <div class="relative w-full max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-[230px] aspect-[9/16] rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden bg-black border-4 border-slate-900 dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-2xl group">
                <video 
                  id="prototype-demo-video"
                  controls 
                  playsinline 
                  preload="metadata"
                  poster="/assets/img/prototype.webp"
                  aria-label="Video demostrativo del prototipo Slimergy en funcionamiento"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                >
                  <source src="/assets/img/prototipo_video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                  Tu navegador no soporta reproducción de video.
                </video>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 dark:text-slimergy-app-muted mt-2 font-medium">Video del prototipo en vivo</span>
            </div>

            <div class="sm:col-span-7 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-sm reveal-init">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slimergy-green-light dark:bg-slimergy-green/15 text-slimergy-green flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span>Actualización cada 2s vía MQTT</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-sm reveal-init reveal-d1">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slimergy-green-light dark:bg-slimergy-green/15 text-slimergy-green flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span>Control ON/OFF relay &lt;100 ms</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-sm reveal-init reveal-d2">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slimergy-green-light dark:bg-slimergy-green/15 text-slimergy-green flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span>App iOS y Android (React Native)</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-sm reveal-init reveal-d3">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slimergy-green-light dark:bg-slimergy-green/15 text-slimergy-green flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span>Cálculo de tarifa CFE DAC 2026</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
